msgctxt "Route115_Text_NeverKnowWhenCavePokemonWillAppear"
msgid ""
"Exploring a cave isn't like walking\n"
"on a road.\p"
"You never know when wild POKéMON will\n"
"appear. It's full of suspense.$"
msgstr ""
"探索洞窟和在路上走可不一样。\p"
"你永远不知道野生宝可梦什么时\n"
"候会出现。真是充满了紧张感。$"

